<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tweefontein lifts interim shr, div up.</title>
<headline>Tweefontein lifts interim shr, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     361.1     vs   305.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 360.0     vs   305.0</p>
<p>    Net income		 6.27     vs   5.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    6.27     vs   5.30</p>
<p>    Dividend income	  6.39     vs   5.43</p>
<p>Div payable May 21</p>
<p>on register May 9</p>
<p>Full name: Tweefontein United Collieries</p>
<p>NOTE - The dividend is payable from the United Kingdom Transfer office in South African rand at the exchange rate ruling on May 9.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
